        <div></div>
        <p class="text-fluid-0">Category</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="ratio-portrait"><img src="/media/placeholder.svg" alt="image" loading="lazy" width="900" height="600" /></figure>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div>
        <figure class="ratio-portrait"><img src="/media/placeholder.svg" alt="image" loading="lazy" width="900" height="600" /></figure>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-fluid-2">About Ecoessentials</h2>
          <p class="text-fluid-0">{fs}</p>
          <div>
            <div></div>
            <p class="text-fluid-0">Visit website</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-fluid-2">What we did</h2>
            <p class="text-fluid-0">Based on the research, PixelPundits developed a multi-pronged digital marketing strategy:</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-fluid-0">Website Revitalization We redesigned the website for a cleaner UX/UI, ensured mobile optimization, and integrated conversion rate optimization (CRO) elements like clear CTAs and simplified checkout. Search Engine Optimization (SEO): We executed on-page SEO, created a content marketing calendar with educational blog posts, and addressed technical SEO issues like site speed. Targeted Digital Advertising: We launched highly targeted Google Ads and visually engaging social media campaigns on Instagram and Facebook, emphasizing EcoEssentials' unique selling propositions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-fluid-2">Final presentation of the project</h2>
          <div>
            <div>
              {(items || []).map((it) => (
                <div class="grid-auto gap-fluid-l">
                  <div></div>
                  <figure class="ratio-portrait"><img src="/media/placeholder.svg" alt="image" loading="lazy" width="900" height="600" /></figure>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-fluid-2">Results</h2>
            <p class="text-fluid-0">Within six months of implementing PixelPundits' strategy, EcoEssentials experienced a dramatic transformation:</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-fluid-0">45% Increase in Online Sales: The most significant outcome, directly attributed to improved website performance and increased qualified traffic. 120% Rise in Organic Website Traffic: Thanks to enhanced SEO and a robust content marketing strategy, EcoEssentials saw a substantial increase in visitors from search engines. 60% Reduction in Bounce Rate: The redesigned website and improved user experience kept visitors engaged and exploring more pages. 25% Improvement in Conversion Rate: A more streamlined checkout process and trust-building elements led to a higher percentage of visitors making a purchase. Expanded Reach and Brand Awareness: Social media campaigns significantly broadened EcoEssentials' audience, leading to increased brand mentions and engagement.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div>
